      "slug": "the-agentic-economy-is-a-trust-problem",
      "title": "The agentic economy is a trust problem, not a technology problem",
      "description": "Agents can already research, compare and execute. The hard part is deciding what they may do with money, and proving what they did. A case for wallets with rules.",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "keywords": [
        "agentic economy",
        "AI agents trust",
        "AI spending rules",
        "wallets with rules",
        "verifiable receipts"
      ]
